  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758963,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Minute Solution: The Video Game (Nintendo Wii) - Synopsis\n\nGet fit and have fun with *10 Minute Solution: The Video Game* for the Nintendo Wii! This innovative fitness title breaks down total-body workouts into manageable, 10-minute sessions, making it easier than ever to incorporate exercise into your busy lifestyle. Forget lengthy gym routines – *10 Minute Solution* offers a diverse range of workouts, from invigorating cardio to effective strength training, all designed to deliver powerful results.\n\nCustomize your fitness journey by mixing and matching workout sessions, creating your own personalized routines to target specific muscle groups or fitness goals. The game features a variety of instructors and workout styles to keep things fresh and motivating. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned fitness enthusiast, *10 Minute Solution* adapts to your level, providing a challenging yet accessible experience. Stackable sessions allow you to gradually increase intensity and duration as you progress.  Get ready to sweat, smile, and transform your body – 10 minutes at a time!"
    },
